    "Historical searches are preserved, not silently migrated or re-executed. Separate current assessments may change their displayed qualification. Other non-predicate evidence validation gaps and unavailable sources retain review warnings.",
    "Contractual source-review prompt target still defaults to Execution events; user can select Entities & relationships. Automatic appropriate prompt routing needs further UX work.",
    "Actor/profile duplicates, broader entity normalization, role grammar, other relationship meanings, General engine default profile, browser quota and production chunk size remain open.",
